{"3690100": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Among Space", "steam_appid": 3690100, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690100/extras/2d54f3c409b4143f2a27d8d8fb11ecf9.poster.avif?t=1777951958\" width=1170 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690100/extras/2d54f3c409b4143f2a27d8d8fb11ecf9.webm?t=1777951958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690100/extras/2d54f3c409b4143f2a27d8d8fb11ecf9.mp4?t=1777951958\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the subject of a failed quantum teleportation experiment. Due to a calculation error, the destination point was incorrect. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have found yourself in a recently abandoned research complex that studied the caves of planet EC-10013, from which local creatures have escaped—creatures whose behavior has only been partially studied.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hack into systems, study employee records about the entities, follow the instructions of your AI assistant — Neutrino, and find the key to your escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690100/extras/07d3c5676068c495c066aa539628b114.poster.avif?t=1777951958\" width=1170 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690100/extras/07d3c5676068c495c066aa539628b114.webm?t=1777951958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690100/extras/07d3c5676068c495c066aa539628b114.mp4?t=1777951958\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Experiment with the environment, create distractions, find your way forward, and defend yourself from threats using whatever you can find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most objects have various physical properties. They can be picked up, thrown, hurled, collided with each other, and used in any way you can imagine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690100/extras/b0437454d03c6b905f49e75ab8eb0f9f.poster.avif?t=1777951958\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690100/extras/b0437454d03c6b905f49e75ab8eb0f9f.webm?t=1777951958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690100/extras/b0437454d03c6b905f49e75ab8eb0f9f.mp4?t=1777951958\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the built-in Gravity Glove in your suit — it allows you to lift objects of any weight and store various equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690100/extras/5fe58beab55046cc31fbe52ff8ef5371.poster.avif?t=1777951958\" width=1170 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690100/extras/5fe58beab55046cc31fbe52ff8ef5371.webm?t=1777951958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690100/extras/5fe58beab55046cc31fbe52ff8ef5371.mp4?t=1777951958\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invisibility Grenade, Audio Player, or… Rubber Duck?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a variety of equipment to distract monsters and stay out of sight. From a crumpled paper ball to an impulse repulsor that fires energy spheres. All of it can be stored in the built-in glove — with no limits whatsoever!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690100/extras/1cfadc0ff94d7fa8f65e8dbb9e82c51f.poster.avif?t=1777951958\" width=1170 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690100/extras/1cfadc0ff94d7fa8f65e8dbb9e82c51f.webm?t=1777951958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690100/extras/1cfadc0ff94d7fa8f65e8dbb9e82c51f.mp4?t=1777951958\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the built-in cheat system designed for testing and experimentation within the game. You have access to a developer console with a wide range of commands that allow you to modify game parameters, spawn physics objects, test interaction mechanics, and debug various systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can spawn an unlimited number of objects, manipulate the environment, and experiment with the physics without any restrictions, either to better understand the game systems or simply to create chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690100/extras/2c89f4390990fbb8327855a78ac10d43.poster.avif?t=1777951958\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690100/extras/2c89f4390990fbb8327855a78ac10d43.webm?t=1777951958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690100/extras/2c89f4390990fbb8327855a78ac10d43.mp4?t=1777951958\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690100/extras/2d54f3c409b4143f2a27d8d8fb11ecf9.poster.avif?t=1777951958\" width=1170 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690100/extras/2d54f3c409b4143f2a27d8d8fb11ecf9.webm?t=1777951958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690100/extras/2d54f3c409b4143f2a27d8d8fb11ecf9.mp4?t=1777951958\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the subject of a failed quantum teleportation experiment. Due to a calculation error, the destination point was incorrect. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have found yourself in a recently abandoned research complex that studied the caves of planet EC-10013, from which local creatures have escaped—creatures whose behavior has only been partially studied.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hack into systems, study employee records about the entities, follow the instructions of your AI assistant — Neutrino, and find the key to your escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690100/extras/07d3c5676068c495c066aa539628b114.poster.avif?t=1777951958\" width=1170 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690100/extras/07d3c5676068c495c066aa539628b114.webm?t=1777951958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690100/extras/07d3c5676068c495c066aa539628b114.mp4?t=1777951958\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Experiment with the environment, create distractions, find your way forward, and defend yourself from threats using whatever you can find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most objects have various physical properties. They can be picked up, thrown, hurled, collided with each other, and used in any way you can imagine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690100/extras/b0437454d03c6b905f49e75ab8eb0f9f.poster.avif?t=1777951958\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690100/extras/b0437454d03c6b905f49e75ab8eb0f9f.webm?t=1777951958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690100/extras/b0437454d03c6b905f49e75ab8eb0f9f.mp4?t=1777951958\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the built-in Gravity Glove in your suit — it allows you to lift objects of any weight and store various equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690100/extras/5fe58beab55046cc31fbe52ff8ef5371.poster.avif?t=1777951958\" width=1170 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690100/extras/5fe58beab55046cc31fbe52ff8ef5371.webm?t=1777951958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690100/extras/5fe58beab55046cc31fbe52ff8ef5371.mp4?t=1777951958\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invisibility Grenade, Audio Player, or… Rubber Duck?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a variety of equipment to distract monsters and stay out of sight. From a crumpled paper ball to an impulse repulsor that fires energy spheres. All of it can be stored in the built-in glove — with no limits whatsoever!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690100/extras/1cfadc0ff94d7fa8f65e8dbb9e82c51f.poster.avif?t=1777951958\" width=1170 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690100/extras/1cfadc0ff94d7fa8f65e8dbb9e82c51f.webm?t=1777951958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690100/extras/1cfadc0ff94d7fa8f65e8dbb9e82c51f.mp4?t=1777951958\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the built-in cheat system designed for testing and experimentation within the game. You have access to a developer console with a wide range of commands that allow you to modify game parameters, spawn physics objects, test interaction mechanics, and debug various systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can spawn an unlimited number of objects, manipulate the environment, and experiment with the physics without any restrictions, either to better understand the game systems or simply to create chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690100/extras/2c89f4390990fbb8327855a78ac10d43.poster.avif?t=1777951958\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690100/extras/2c89f4390990fbb8327855a78ac10d43.webm?t=1777951958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690100/extras/2c89f4390990fbb8327855a78ac10d43.mp4?t=1777951958\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "You are the subject of a failed quantum teleportation experiment. Due to a calculation error, you have found yourself in an abandoned complex on planet EC-10013, where dangerous creatures roam—creatures that emerged from the depths of its caves. Can you find a way to escape?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Russian, French, Ukrainian, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690100/484bcf0dd692688450ab29e99e583fa028e3269c/header.jpg?t=1777951958", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690100/fdc6393217067bf42b287b9258577d148735563a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1777951958", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690100/fdc6393217067bf42b287b9258577d148735563a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1777951958", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core I3-8100 or AMD Ryzen 3 3200G<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 650 Ti<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Low quality settings</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Undos"], "publishers": ["Undos"], "demos": [{"appid": 4618480, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 1, "description": "Multi-player"}, {"id": 9, "description": "Co-op"}, {"id": 38, "description": "Online Co-op"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id": 23, "description": "Steam Cloud"}, {"id": 15, "description": "Stats"}, {"id": 25, "description": "Steam Leaderboards"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "25", "d